Frontend UI Prompt for Influencer Engagement Bot
Create a modern, minimalist React application with Apple's new liquid glass UI aesthetic for an Influencer Engagement Bot. The application should have 2 main pages with fluid animations, glassmorphism effects, and a premium feel.
Design System & Visual Style
Color Palette

Background: Deep dark gradient (#0a0a0f to #1a1a2e)
Glass surfaces: Semi-transparent white/gray overlays with backdrop blur
Accent colors: Vibrant gradients (blue to purple, #3b82f6 to #a855f7)
Text: White primary, gray-400 secondary
Success states: Emerald green (#10b981)
Error states: Red (#ef4444)

Glass Morphism Effects

Use backdrop-filter: blur(20px) with background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05)
Subtle borders with border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1)
Soft shadows: box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3)
Smooth rounded corners: border-radius: 20px to 24px

Animation Principles

Smooth transitions: transition: all 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1)
Hover states with subtle scale and glow effects
Loading states with pulsing animations
Page transitions with fade and slide effects
Micro-interactions on all interactive elements

