Component Details
Navigation Bar

Fixed top position with glass effect
Logo on left with animated gradient
Navigation links: "Send Email" | "View Sent"
Smooth underline animation on hover
Active state indicator with glow effect

Hero Section

Large gradient text: "Influencer Engagement Hub"
Subtitle with typing animation effect
Floating particles or subtle background animation

Email Composer Card

Large glass card centered on page
Inputs with floating labels
Each input field has:

Glass background with border
Focus state: glowing border animation
Icon on the left (Lucide React icons)
Smooth transition on interaction



Input Fields Specification

Influencer Name - Text input with user icon
Email - Email input with mail icon, validation indicator
Subject - Text input with document icon
Description - Textarea (4-5 rows) with edit icon
Category - Dropdown (meeting, negotiation, follow-up, collaboration) with tag icon
Priority - Toggle buttons (high, medium, low) with signal icon

Send Button

Large, prominent gradient button (blue to purple)
Hover: scale up slightly, increase glow
Loading state: spinning icon inside button
Success animation: checkmark with confetti
Disabled state when form incomplete

Status Toast Notifications

Glass toast appearing from top-right
Success: green accent with checkmark
Error: red accent with X icon
Auto-dismiss after 3 seconds with slide-out animation

