Global UI Elements
Typography

Headings: Inter or SF Pro Display, bold weights
Body: Inter or SF Pro Text, regular
Code/IDs: JetBrains Mono or SF Mono

Spacing System

Use 4px base unit
Standard spacing: 8px, 16px, 24px, 32px, 48px

Responsive Breakpoints

Mobile: < 640px
Tablet: 640px - 1024px
Desktop: > 1024px

Icons

Use Lucide React icons throughout
Consistent 20px or 24px size
Smooth transition on hover

Animations Library

Framer Motion for complex animations
CSS transitions for simple hover effects
Page transitions: fade + slide
Element entrance: stagger animation

Technical Implementation Notes
State Management

Use React hooks (useState, useEffect)
Form validation with visual feedback
Loading, success, error states for API calls

API Integration Points

POST /api/send-email - Send new email
GET /api/emails - Fetch sent emails with filters

Form Validation

Real-time validation with error messages below inputs
Visual indicators (red border, error icon)
Disable submit until all required fields valid

Performance

Lazy load email list
Debounce search input
Optimize animations with will-change property
Use React.memo for card components

Accessibility

Keyboard navigation support
ARIA labels on all interactive elements
Focus visible states
Color contrast meeting WCAG AA standards

Special Effects

Gradient Text: Animated gradient on headings
Floating Elements: Subtle parallax on scroll
Glow Effects: On hover and focus states
Ripple Effect: On button clicks
Success Confetti: On successful email send
Smooth Scrolling: Between sections

Create this application with meticulous attention to detail, smooth animations, and a premium feel that matches Apple's design language. Every interaction should feel fluid and delightful.